  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>The bottom of Africa, the top of the world. Capetown is an amazing and vibrant city. Part of its intrigue is that it's positioned in a truly beautiful part of the world.</p>\n<p>While in Capetown we stayed in an airstream camper positioned on the roof of a hotel, and at a great little boutique hotel in ___ called ____.&nbsp;</p>"
    },
