    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>When traveling to any far away destination you often wonder if any of the \"touristy\" things are actually worth it. In our case, deciding to ask a guide to take us to the Cape of Good Hope was a great idea (shout out to Joe!). Along the way we say amazing scenery, seals, ostriches, biting penguins, and more.</p>"
    },
