    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Cape of Good Hope is more or less the most southern point in Africa. The guy in the pink shirt stood in this position for probably 35 minutes!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "gallery",
      "columns": 1,
      "images": [
        {
          "filename": "IMG_0045-001.jpg",
          "src_url": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/58d6f67f9de4bba5f5e41958/1490637537912-AQPSK9QT4GYSOY4TZ9EH/IMG_0045-001.jpg?format=original"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>For those of you wondering if you should go on a safari while in Capetown, I say go for it. While it's likely not as impressive as other safaris near Johannesburg, if you don't plan on coming back to Africa for a little while, it's really fun and memorable.</p>"
    },
